      {
        "id": "0b160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000046",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Your physiotherapist will explain what they find, the treatment they suggest, its benefits and risks, and the alternatives, before they start. You can ask questions, ask for a chaperone, or stop the assessment or treatment at any time. Some assessments mean undressing to your underwear; you can bring shorts and a vest top if you prefer.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "0b160000-0000-4000-8000-000000000047",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Tick each statement you agree to. You can change your mind at any time.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
